## @file
#  Executes TPM 2.0 requests from OS or BIOS
#
#  Exact PP schemas and a verified LOCK_NOW flags policy are required before execution.
#  Every TPM mutation requires fresh F12 console confirmation; ESC/30s timeout rejects.
#
#  Caution: This module requires additional review when modified.
#  This driver will have external input - variable.
#  This external input must be validated carefully to avoid security issue.
#
